1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,289
Match stats tell you what happened: 57%
possession, 13 shots.

2
00:00:05,339 --> 00:00:07,350
Not why the game turned.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:12,179
Pivot finds the moments that turned a
match, explains why,

4
00:00:12,229 --> 00:00:15,850
and lets you replay it with one thing
changed.

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:20,162
Here's a synthetic match. Harbour City 3,
Northgate 1.

6
00:00:20,212 --> 00:00:23,588
Pivot found three turning points. A red
card.

7
00:00:23,638 --> 00:00:27,166
A substitution that pulled Harbour City
deeper.

8
00:00:27,216 --> 00:00:30,364
And a second change that won control back.

9
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:37,180
Pick one. The AI explains why it mattered,
and every number is checked.

10
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:42,793
Northgate's passes fell from 12 to 6.
Hover it to see its source.

11
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,713
So did the red card decide it?

12
00:00:45,763 --> 00:00:51,926
Remove it, and Pivot replays the rest of
the match 200 times each way.

13
00:00:51,976 --> 00:00:58,850
Northgate's shots double, and Harbour
City's win chance drops from 80% to 52%.

14
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:03,584
Two minutes after the card, Harbour City
scored from a corner.

15
00:01:03,634 --> 00:01:08,850
At quarter speed: four attackers, three
defenders, nobody tight on them.

16
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:14,538
And it's personal. Switch to Fan, pick
Harbour City, follow Darbelnoez,

17
00:01:14,588 --> 00:01:19,254
and the story is told from your side. In
Chinese, or Spanish.

18
00:01:19,304 --> 00:01:21,650
Every version is checked again.

19
00:01:22,100 --> 00:01:26,430
Every card comes from a Microsoft Agent
Framework workflow.

20
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:30,290
A Judge confirms the moment, an Explainer
writes it,

21
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:32,889
a Verifier recomputes every number.

22
00:01:32,939 --> 00:01:38,531
Here it caught the model giving Harbour
City the other team's pass accuracy,

23
00:01:38,581 --> 00:01:39,793
and sent it back.

24
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:42,817
The agents run on Azure AI Foundry.

25
00:01:42,867 --> 00:01:46,850
Results live in Cosmos DB, matches in Blob
Storage.

26
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,315
Every match here is synthetic, as the
rules require.

27
00:01:51,365 --> 00:01:54,350
Next: real match data. This is Pivot.
